==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Togekiss|57}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Magical Shot''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Ralts|52}} and {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Kirlia|53}}, both from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

